{"projectInfo":{"name":"配置MPLS L3VPN采用GRE隧道","path":"mpls_l3vpn_gre","visibility":2,"categoryId":44,"introduction":"CE 1和CE 2属于VPN 1。在运营商骨干网上，PE设备具备MPLS能力，P设备只提供纯IP功能，不具备MPLS能力。在骨干网上使用GRE隧道封装并转发VPN报文，实现MPLS L3VPN。在PE上配置隧道策略，指定VPN流量使用的隧道类型为GRE。","label":["MPLS L3VPN"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"P","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\P.cfg"},{"resourceName":"CE_1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\CE_1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PE_1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PE_1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PE_2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PE_2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"CE_2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\CE_2.cfg"}]}